iderationClassifiedAsEquityFairValueDisclosure" scale="0" id="Narr_KPLZRbUupUy0XHxSVB-geA">zero</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">The out-licensed&#160;partnership program with Novartis Institutes for Biomedical Research, Inc. (&#8220;Novartis Institutes&#8221;) (NZV930), also acquired as part of the Surface Acquisition, was terminated by Novartis Institutes with an effective date of October 2, 2024. As a result, during the first quarter of 2024, the Company recognized a net impairment charge of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_chrs_SurfaceOncologyIncMember_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_chrs_OutLicensesWithNovartisInstitutesMember_GyCopsbzWkOztFUKEAL59g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsAndContingentValueRightsLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_2PkD-j9XEkG97_eqngAybw">6.8</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">&#160;million in&#160;</span><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_X-3Ty2vkc0GexCDAAb62dQ;"><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">selling, general and administrative </span></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">expenses&#160;in the consolidated statements of operations relating to the write-off of the net carrying value of the Novartis Institutes out-license intangible asset of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_chrs_SurfaceOncologyIncMember_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_chrs_OutLicen