n:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_b6oWVORPPUSfDnsR9jvVOQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesNoncurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_jS2iUo1eY0iNu2DhtjfXVg_8_6">29,329</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_spwAQFPWNEarr5HZrym-mA" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_acP9t3khtUu4Ruy6TqCzIw" continuedAt="Tb_acP9t3khtUu4Ruy6TqCzIw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"><b style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">6.</b></span><b style="font-weight:bold;">Discontinued Operations</b></p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 2, 2024, the Company and Intas entered into the UDENYCA Purchase Agreement. On April 11, 2025, the Company completed the divestiture of the UDENYCA Business to Intas for upfront, all-cash consideration of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_4_11_2025_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DiscontinuedOperationsDisposedOfBySaleMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_UdenycaBusinessMember_EliWtYZOMUqfFda0JmMIgg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationConsideration" scale="6" id="Narr_9b9NliCh1k-EhLQp8Rf-Jg">483.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, inclusive of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_4_11_2025_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DiscontinuedOperationsDisposedOfBySaleMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_UdenycaBusinessMember_EliWtYZOMUqfFda0JmMIgg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationInventory1" scale="6" id="Narr_7GY38ZUK806TRgP1gHdeuw">118.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for UDENYCA product inventory. The Company recognized a net gain on the UDENYCA Sale of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_4_11_2025_To_4_11_2025_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DiscontinuedOperationsDisposedOfBySaleMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_UdenycaBusinessMember_l0n2WNEET0qHMqC7yFqhmQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DiscontinuedOperationGainLossFromDisposalOfDiscontinuedOperationBeforeIncomeTax" scale="6" id="Narr_JTpD281bIkmlKYKKWjyY1Q">338.3</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, which included the cash receipts less net assets transferred to Accord or otherwise derecognized and transaction expenses of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_4_11_2025_To_4_11_2025_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DiscontinuedOperationsDisposedOfBySaleMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_UdenycaBusinessMember_l0n2WNEET0qHMqC7yFqhmQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationTransactionExpense" scale="6" id="Narr_AzQ6r54D50Wbtb3IHoH5gA">10.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. The Company is eligible to receive two additional Earnout Payments of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_4_11_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_chrs_ScenarioNetSalesExceeding300MillionQuartersEndingSeptember302026Member_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DiscontinuedOperationsDisposedOfBySaleMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_UdenycaBusinessMember_a1xWUtDO0ESdRTSMgaVJmw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:DiscontinuedOperationAmountsOfMaterialContingentAssetsReceivable" scale="6" id="Narr_IuzTuzTAp0GXyC55t-z5iA">37.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million&#160;<span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_UGcuVWgT-0eqhe6NZYWiIQ;"><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">each</span></span>. The first such payment is payable by Intas to the Company if Net Sales of UDENYCA for four consecutive fiscal quarters from July 1, 2025 through September 30, 2026 are equal to or greater than $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_4_11_2025_To_4_11_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_chrs_ScenarioNetSalesExceeding300MillionQuartersEndingSeptember302026Member_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_UdenycaBusinessMember_RosWZ2P0ZkadtzJs5QqmYQ" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:ThresholdNetSalesPaymentTrigger" scale="6" id="Narr_5yDjFYGz7UyBe03Bl8myOg">300</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, and the second such payment is payable by Intas to the Company if Net Sales of UDENYCA for four consecutive fiscal quarters from July 1, 2025 through March 31, 2027 are equal to or greater than $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_4_11_2025_To_4_11_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_chrs_ScenarioNetSalesExceeding350MillionQuartersEndingMarch312027Member_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_UdenycaBusinessMember_d5HQ570Pfk63IE5wg2Zcug" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:ThresholdNetSalesPaymentTrigger" scale="6" id="Narr_aakj6JX-BUWo_jtjMlOWmA">350</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million.</p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On June 26, 2024, the Company completed the sale of its YUSIMRY immunology franchise, which comprised certain assets, including certain YUSIMRY intellectual property, contracts, YUSIMRY inventory, and all activities related to research and development of YUSIMRY, for upfront cash consideration of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_6_26_2024_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_YusimryImmunologyFranchiseMember_jwl7tV7tZ0SNRnMx24Ywdw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationConsideration" scale="6" id="Narr_vzbwcw2ODUOBEO8cc69a6Q">40.0</ix:nonFraction> million and the assumption of certain liabilities, including $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_6_26_2024_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_YusimryImmunologyFranchiseMember_jwl7tV7tZ0SNRnMx24Ywdw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationConsiderationInFormOfInventoryPurchaseCommitments" scale="6" id="Narr_DoY4Ug7SlUuzYfbk6RrQ7A">17.0</ix:nonFraction> million of inventory purchase commitments, resulting in a net gain of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_6_26_2024_To_6_26_2024_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DiscontinuedOperationsDisposedOfBySaleMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_YusimryImmunologyFranchiseMember_yZ4XTSQHBUWwWopTSWOnLQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DiscontinuedOperationGainLossFromDisposalOfDiscontinuedOperationBeforeIncomeTax" scale="6" id="Narr_zvDtk_J3dUG6EkD1uVqNXQ">22.8</ix:nonFraction> million. </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:27.35pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:23pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">96</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:91.06%;border:0;margin:30pt 4.47% 30pt 4.47%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:4.47%;padding-right:4.47%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:7.2pt;min-height:20.15pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><a style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';" href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_CTntdD2F906Am4VQkjcepQ_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_MmTZ7YnjP0-ozS4w88CGEA_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_VY5HI8Wg2kyziI--yhhj-A_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_AMjPNgchZEaelMeprOzDoA_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_1FLZxSFl7ke7mNr_jhGQvg_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_GBzhqfNCoEyMcrvkTMplvw_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_uG4VWyDqP0WcYPK9YMqUCA_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_J4avA4q8_EKGxVqCfXc96w_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_pypk1od5zUqPMiKSd6T_Bg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_UBcLwj6wsE-li7rNjCJHEA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_YbbbEQMFeUuGD4pObKLmAQ_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_JktBhXZSsU-zCIPJ9ncs-w_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_-xLVKv2vW0GmiHsVLi-OIg_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_rKd4VIo9Ak69TvpEkw3uYw_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_ws9qKXpy2kecAC1DgH_vsQ_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_Sv457Z5cbkGeYeeHrMb1Fw_12_0"></a><a id="Tc_y5oyTTBuAk2DvdCUfO-jjg_12_6"></a><a id="Tc_rhToLffefEO2MZ16v95H3Q_13_0"></a><a id="Tc_6M4XZdvcEUyE3V6uCYpfbg_14_0"></a><a id="Tc_B6pDNcGQrUSaZg-h_JoZ0w_15_0"></a><a id="Tc_tkLs9aDlN02KbLyj6cw00Q_15_3"></a><a id="Tc_ilbf3031BUKp74VLAhbhwg_15_6"></a><a id="Tc_POBM5Anz_EiFyZHg1WOrvw_16_0"></a><a id="Tc_boHI-v-fdEWWjh2R9tkvTw_16_2"></a><a id="Tc_AQw5n--egUGGOTUhtfAUTw_16_5"></a><a id="Tc_H89J68CjTUOYznRpOJ8iAQ_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_txV2JboGFkq7G_9Oc10xCg_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_6J31Jz_cwUu-BgCd85AwEA_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_DENH0ZNsxk22WIPWkNCAgg_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_MWhqtqJQ2UqeuhpcIAyDRw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_yMU-SjEJLk-4XQ1pFuNGIg_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_rOBy7x-aekq7FnNHIWwqVQ_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_cYnoIaKAvEqXQ2yv9tCeSA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_y8R4e6bEUkitBIGNl9aU3w_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_-jHPBm4yTUWDHFmOqmuLYA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_dpdcUlQvBk-e3U9UyVmlMg_6_2"></a><a id="Tc_cUreTFT2IkOnudJJS9NLaA_6_5"></a><a id="Tc_ICH_2AAw2kqOPkRH8wSZhg_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_i3KMD6uUg0mkNZJnGoAMXw_1_1"></a><a id="Tc_iDChiXxUk0G-nXeP7dNGPg_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_GxlHbfTviEGO49810y22zw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_mjdPUkfa_kCOcc_z2FpxzA_3_1"></a><a id="Tc_zEusIvS2X0-K0zy5w7FPaw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_SmszrFomwUC93yIsoGC7fw_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_UyP9PX2I0k2xMayrssU_EA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_2MOsL9DRQkikAalOp8unsw_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_sGpK6Gi-7Eu5fMhqJHDmbQ_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_al0gQRZ1VUS9uYmojnvDnQ_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_O9yDl987tEq_hEcvk98J_Q_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_vdSvIO6xpkiGKIWzBuGm-w_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_mEghE_k4F0iBGDlxBSVrOA_11_1"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_acP9t3khtUu4Ruy6TqCzIw_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_acP9t3khtUu4Ruy6TqCzIw_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March 1, 2024, the Company completed the sale of its CIMERLI ophthalmology franchise through the sale of its subsidiary, Coherus Ophthalmology LLC, to Sandoz for upfront, all-cash consideration of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_3_1_2024_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_CimerliOphthalmologyFranchiseMember_EkNE8-2dDUGez9sJ9iVxJQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationConsideration" scale="6" id="Narr_9nuKi0Ry1k6ZYS8z-QPJFQ">187.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, inclusive of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_3_1_2024_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_CimerliOphthalmologyFranchiseMember_EkNE8-2dDUGez9sJ9iVxJQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="chrs:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationAdditionalConsiderationForProductInventoryAndPrepaidManufacturingAssets" scale="6" id="Narr_k0oLLuH4_U60BYv-3DfnLQ">17.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for CIMERLI product inventory and prepaid manufacturing assets (the &#8220;CIMERLI Sale&#8221; and, together with the UDENYCA Sale and the YUSIMRY Sale, the &#8220;Sale Transactions&#8221;). As a result, the Company recognized a&#160;<span style="background:#ffffff;">net gain</span>&#160;of&#160;$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2024_To_3_1_2024_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DiscontinuedOperationsDisposedOfBySaleMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_chrs_CimerliOphthalmologyFranchiseMember_QLzUDdsaMUqohjmaM0mc9A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DiscontinuedOperationGainLossFromDisposalOfDiscontinuedOperationBeforeIncomeTax" scale="6" id="Narr_AiktZBvJPEOMw26-2snLvQ">153.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million on the CIMERLI Sale in 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The UDENYCA Sale represented the last and most significant divestiture of the Company&#8217;s biosimilar businesses, which comprised the UDENYCA, YUSIMRY and CIMERLI franchises; therefore, the strategic shift criteria had been met and discontinued operations presentation has been included in the consolidated financial statements for all periods presented.</p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company used a portion of the proceeds of the UDENYCA Sale to repay substantially all of the outstanding 2026 Convertible Notes and to buy out the right to receive royalties on net sales of UDENYCA in accordance with the Revenue Purchase and Sale Agreement, and thus the related interest expense and loss on debt extinguishment have been presented within discontinued operations. Interest expense related to the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis_us-gaap_SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_A3W7VUd4NUOENPc4S7mtow" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_mq14Vf0E0kOsIMuga6ferQ">175.0</ix:nonFraction> million portion of the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_TermLoansMember_97S7LWRct06YXitLbAux8w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_AloOEwxgHUW-Az8PTVotlA">250.0</ix:nonFraction> million aggregate principal amount senior secured term loan facility, entered into on January 5, 2022, was required to be repaid in April 2024 in connection with the CIMERLI Sale and has also been presented within discontinued operations.</p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">The following table presents a reconciliation of discontinued operations for the periods presented:</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_spwAQFPWNEarr5HZrym-mA" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsIncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresTextBlock" id="Group_LNaoZ-jxS0al5RPnplgCJQ" continuedAt="Group_LNaoZ-jxS0al5RPnplgCJQ_2" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;m