idth:13.84%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis_us-gaap_SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_hGGQgleoC0Cm15wjWSeLmw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfDebt" scale="3" id="Tc_fwwxSFue_0KQ4WCZzArHZA_3_6">175,000</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.08%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:17.06%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">April 1, 2024</p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:43.28%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">Continuing Operations</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.91%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.08%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:13.84%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis_us-gaap_SegmentContinuingOperationsMember_SgvrIQ1PekiT2of7hn7Olg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="3" id="Tc_u-7Opas_SkSXLN0m2qgk3g_4_3">4,315</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.79%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.08%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:13.84%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis_us-gaap_SegmentContinuingOperationsMember_8jGDvtytiEGyXpEeyS9qiw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfDebt" scale="3" id="Tc_pFz8_bJdSUOszJ3hVpvckw_4_6">75,000</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.08%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:17.06%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">May 8, 2024</p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_r0t7SlyKkEiV3Ailih90Xw" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_Rf2IIKnDBkOq5ulyg5L1PQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_kxtkfr2WP0-yr9brcmIbiw">1.5</ix:nonFraction>%</b><b style="font-weight:bold;"> Convertible Senior Subordinated Notes due April 2026</b></p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">In April 2020, the Company issued and sold </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_Rf2IIKnDBkOq5ulyg5L1PQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_1v9sUDsJXkG19PhW7Mq73w">230.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">&#160;million aggregate principal amount of its&#160;</span>1.5<span style="background:#ffffff;">% Convertible Senior Subordinated Notes due 2026 (the &#8220;2026 Convertible Notes&#8221;).&#160;</span>The 2026 Convertible Notes accrue interest at a rate of&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2020_To_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_nBso1gWvjUGT-idoWOXpWA" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateTerms" id="Narr_8PDn6L_1KkOLPguRGzPJtg"><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_r0t7SlyKkEiV3Ailih90Xw" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_Rf2IIKnDBkOq5ulyg5L1PQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_NFdskF-tqkOUwxtKVHhw8Q">1.5</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> per annum, payable semi-annually in arrears on April 15 and October 15 of each year </span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="background:#ffffff;">and mature on&#160;</span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2020_To_4_30_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_nBso1gWvjUGT-idoWOXpWA" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate" id="Narr_Iyqu6XST3kao6DapJUEXIQ"><span style="background:#ffffff;">April 15, 2026</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="background:#ffffff;">, unless earlier repurchased or converted.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The 2026 Convertible Notes have customary provisions relating to the occurrence of &#8220;events of default&#8221; (as defined in the Indenture for the 2026 Convertible Notes). <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_3n4JYmleaU2_ypzf1471og" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCovenantCompliance" id="Narr_SUjIysIPtUSfKZP4OwY_qA">As of December 31, 2025, the Company was in full compliance with these covenants, and there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_oG8yrMS6vki94Xe6e6rgxg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_T4JB9pspW0-BFeRoQ93sYA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="chrs:NumberOfEventsInDefault" scale="0" id="Narr__Zo7C17cYk6X4iW71lzsBg">no</ix:nonFraction> events of default under the 2026 Convertible Notes.</ix:nonNumeric></p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 15, 2025, the Company paid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_4_15_2025_To_4_15_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member__IULvGxeTkOURPL7p4LZyw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfConvertibleDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_wcwegbjrrU6rx2Q8CW3vHA">170.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million in cash to repurchase $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_4_15_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_HAonTYYPy0OYAS8pHnurtA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentRepurchaseAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_DY3D3fbBtkG0rjHSvlsMkQ">170.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million aggregate principal amount of the 2026 Convertible Notes in privately negotiated transactions. On May 15, 2025, pursuant to the Fundamental Change Repurchase Right (as defined in the indenture, dated as of April 17, 2020 (the &#8220;Indenture&#8221;), between the Company and U.S. Bank Trust Company, National Association (the &#8220;Trustee&#8221;), as trustee), the Company repurchased $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2025_To_5_15_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_L024v8vagEOUO0PLCLyk8A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ExtinguishmentOfDebtAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_qimmN3XiIkSrIY0H26lo_g">59.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million aggregate principal amount of the 2026 Convertible Notes, at a cash repurchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_5_15_2025_G8zDcKYiTE6QYiuBfyQHkA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentRepurchaseAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_sVbPPD5qe0u03PgAR4i6fQ">59.9</ix:nonFraction> million, which amount was equivalent to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_r0t7SlyKkEiV3Ailih90Xw" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2025_To_5_15_2025_sPEX5wrqK0W0biFb_8CqMQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentRedemptionPricePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_cgSOq_Ac_kaerdQG5uaBIA">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the principal amount of the repurchased notes, together with the accrued and unpaid interest. As of December 31, 2025, the outstanding principal amount of the 2026 Convertible Notes was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_T4JB9pspW0-BFeRoQ93sYA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_uesmMTEd00mL6XgacFNq2w">0.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and consisted of the remaining notes that were not tendered for repurchase. In connection with the repurchases, the Company recorded a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_0BcrBNQqq0SmB1e8jqOVUw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_dBuWm0KznkGtxbMm5gTIpQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" sign="-" scale="6" id="Narr_maCjcq8lkkSy5FwusnfOXQ">4.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million loss on debt extinguishment which is classified within discontinued operations in the consolidated statements of operations. The charge in the year ended December 31, 2025, included the write-off of the remaining debt discount and debt issuance costs and related transaction fees.</p><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">The annual effective interest rate is&#160;</span><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_r0t7SlyKkEiV3Ailih90Xw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_85vl9ZBTF0yvKYDu4UFqJA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_-dTXkAK_mUe56R4OJLE1yw">2.1</ix:nonFraction>%<span style="background:#ffffff;"> for the 2026 Convertible Notes, and the following table presents the components of interest expense which have been presented within discontinued operations: </span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_chrs_ConvertibleSeniorSubordinatedNotesDue202615Member_dBuWm0KznkGtxbMm5gTIpQ" name="us-gaap:InterestIncomeAndInterestExpenseDisclosureTableTextBlock" id="Tb_n_uJx5uaA0qtpJ9K413EuA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:63.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.29%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;posi